WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:21.657
Bobby walked into the gym after school.

2
00:00:21.658 --> 00:00:24.144
It was raining.

3
00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:27.632
So Kids Central was inside today.

4
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:30.683
He wished they could go outside and play.

5
00:00:30.684 --> 00:00:34.852
He also wished he had brought a snack.

6
00:00:34.853 --> 00:00:40.744
He was hungry.

7
00:00:40.745 --> 00:00:43.780
"You guys look tired today.

8
00:00:43.781 --> 00:00:48.603
Maybe we need a snack to wake everyone up," Miss Shelly said.

9
00:00:48.604 --> 00:00:51.501
"Yeah!" Bobby agreed.

10
00:00:51.502 --> 00:00:56.423
"My mom makes coffee when she's tired," Nina said.

11
00:00:56.424 --> 00:01:00.712
Miss Shelly laughed.

12
00:01:00.713 --> 00:01:04.213
"We're going to make something better than coffee.

13
00:01:04.214 --> 00:01:12.609
We're going to make our very own Kids Central energy bars.

14
00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:20.891
Everyone, gather around this big bowl."

15
00:01:20.892 --> 00:01:25.859
"Cool. We're making our own snack!" Bobby said.

16
00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:29.056
"We'll make the mixture all together.

17
00:01:29.057 --> 00:01:32.752
The instructions are on the board."

18
00:01:32.753 --> 00:01:43.888
"Step 1: Empty one can of condensed milk and two tablespoons of oil into a bowl. Stir," Miss Shelly read.

19
00:01:43.889 --> 00:01:47.360
Nina picked up an open can on the table.

20
00:01:47.361 --> 00:01:53.334
"Here is the condensed milk."

21
00:01:53.335 --> 00:01:56.086
"I've got the oil."

22
00:01:56.087 --> 00:02:04.970
Jason measured two tablespoons of oil and poured them into the bowl. "Stir!"

23
00:02:04.971 --> 00:02:11.065
"Step 2: Add two cups of toasted oats. Stir."

24
00:02:11.066 --> 00:02:14.430
Nina picked up a bag of toasted oats.

25
00:02:14.431 --> 00:02:17.151
"How much is two cups?"

26
00:02:17.152 --> 00:02:19.937
Bobby handed her a measuring cup.

27
00:02:19.938 --> 00:02:23.944
"Fill this up twice."

28
00:02:23.945 --> 00:02:31.224
"One. Two. There!" Nina grinned. "This is fun."

29
00:02:31.225 --> 00:02:37.471
"Step 3: Add one cup of puffed wheat. Stir."

30
00:02:37.472 --> 00:02:41.817
Jason measured one cup and added it to the mixing bowl.

31
00:02:41.818 --> 00:02:44.792
"Cool. That was easy."

32
00:02:44.793 --> 00:02:51.353
"Step 4: Add half a cup of chopped nuts.

33
00:02:51.354 --> 00:02:56.366
Where are the chopped nuts, Miss Shelly?" Izzie asked.

34
00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.833
"Here are the chopped nuts.

35
00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:01.875
We're using sliced almonds."

36
00:03:01.876 --> 00:03:05.905
Miss Shelly handed her the bag of nuts.

37
00:03:05.906 --> 00:03:09.241
Izzie added them to the mix.

38
00:03:09.242 --> 00:03:13.112
"Step 5: Make it sweet.

39
00:03:13.113 --> 00:03:17.929
Add chocolate chips and raisins," Nina read.

40
00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:24.556
"Ooh, I love raisins."

41
00:03:24.557 --> 00:03:30.607
"Don't forget step 6: Add one cup of sunflower seeds,"

42
00:03:30.608 --> 00:03:33.144
Miss Shelly reminded them.

43
00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:37.994
"And don't forget to stir, stir, stir!" Izzie said.

44
00:03:37.995 --> 00:03:43.287
"I am stirring, stirring, stirring," Nina said.

45
00:03:43.288 --> 00:03:46.977
"Spread onto a greased baking pan.

46
00:03:46.978 --> 00:03:51.212
How do you grease the pan, Miss Shelly?" Bobby asked.

47
00:03:51.213 --> 00:03:55.612
"Pour some oil onto a paper towel," she answered.

48
00:03:55.613 --> 00:03:59.727
"Then rub it around the bottom of the pan.

49
00:03:59.728 --> 00:04:12.909
Miss Shelly gave him a paper towel.

50
00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:17.380
"Now we press the mixture down like this."

51
00:04:17.381 --> 00:04:22.085
Miss Shelly pressed her palms firmly on top of the mixture.

52
00:04:22.086 --> 00:04:26.359
"We're ready to bake!"

53
00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:30.419
Miss Shelly lifted the pan into the toaster oven.

54
00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:40.719
"Bake for 25 minutes at 175 degrees Celsius," Bobby said.

55
00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:45.362
"What will we do for 25 minutes?" Jason asked.

56
00:04:45.363 --> 00:04:47.492
"Let's play soccer.

57
00:04:47.493 --> 00:04:59.304
Girls versus boys!" Bobby shouted.

58
00:04:59.305 --> 00:05:05.754
"Yeah! Boys win!" Jason and Bobby slapped hands.

59
00:05:05.755 --> 00:05:11.940
"Mmm . . . Something smells good!" Bobby cried.

60
00:05:11.941 --> 00:05:15.518
"It's our snack!" Miss Shelly said.

61
00:05:15.519 --> 00:05:18.612
"It's ready for the final step."

62
00:05:18.613 --> 00:05:22.672
"Cut into bars and enjoy," Bobby read.

63
00:05:22.673 --> 00:05:24.718
"That means eat!

64
00:05:24.719 --> 00:05:31.859
Maybe staying inside isn't so bad after all."

65
00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.759
Miss Shelly cut 12 bars.

66
00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.616
Everyone took an energy bar.

67
00:05:37.617 --> 00:05:45.066
"Wow. We made a really good snack!" Izzie said.

68
00:05:45.067 --> 00:05:50.537
"Yeah. And now I have lots of energy," added Bobby.

69
00:05:50.538 --> 00:05:56.964
"Let's go play more soccer!"
